There are two types of MR: the saving throw (percentage chance, scaled 
by level) against polymorph, charm, turning, slowing, drain life, 
striking, speed, cancellation, fear, confusion by scroll, thrown potions 
of sicknes/conf/booze/blindness (and maybe a few I've forgotten), and 
the magic missile resistance (cloak, grey dragon, artifacts) that helps 
against mana attacks (death ray/touch, MM, psi bolt, ...) but also 
against polymorph, destroy armour and striking. Strangely enough, grey 
dragons may still be charmed or cancelled. And yes, this is a bit confusing.

